name    fl-party-xp - the FL levelling curve scales quest and kill XP on the FL maps only
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs FLPX.LevelCurve.Enable = 1, the module's
# fl_xp_for_level rows and this folder in TestBots.ScenarioDirs.
#
# A level-1 mage with 0 XP (.character level resets the XP) on the Forgotten Land map 727 (Kalu'thar
# Haven) and in Northshire (map 0). Stock XP for level 1 is 400, the old FL table's 100: factor 4.
# 1. Quest 90250 "Wake Up in Troubled Waters" (quest level 1, RewardXPDifficulty 3): QuestXP.dbc 40
#    x Rate.XP.Quest 3 = 120 XP; on map 727 x 4 = 480: level 2 with 80 of 900 XP. In Northshire 120:
#    level 1 with 120 of 400 XP. Quest XP never gets rested XP, so both numbers are exact.
# 2. A kill: on map 727 a Wandering Exobeast (80912, level 5-8; the level difference counts up to 4):
#    60 x Rate.XP.Kill 3 = 180, x 4 = 720: level 2 or more (rested XP can double it). In Northshire a
#    Diseased Young Wolf (299, level 1): 50 x 3 = 150, at most 300 with rested XP: still level 1.
# Each creature is respawned by the director first, so a corpse from an earlier run does not count.
timeout 180s
group none

bot c mage level=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Forgotten Land (map 727)
place 727 16560.0 12740.0 123.1
require c alive
log 1a - quest XP on map 727
do gm target c
as gm .character level 1
as gm .quest remove 90250
as gm .quest add 90250
expect c queststatus 90250 complete
as gm .quest reward 90250
expect c queststatus 90250 rewarded
as gm .pinfo
expect output has "Level: 2 (80/900 XP"

log 2a - kill XP on map 727
as gm .character level 1
pick e creature:80912 near c
do gm target e
as gm .respawn
wait 6s
pick e creature:80912 near c
require e alive
do c approach e
wait 1s
do c cast 42921 triggered
do c cast 42921 triggered
waitfor e dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
do gm target c
as gm .pinfo
expect output value Level >= 2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northshire (map 0)
place 0 -8955.0 -90.0 87.5
require c alive
log 1b - quest XP in Northshire (stock)
do gm target c
as gm .character level 1
as gm .quest remove 90250
as gm .quest add 90250
as gm .quest reward 90250
expect c queststatus 90250 rewarded
as gm .pinfo
expect output has "Level: 1 (120/400 XP"

log 2b - kill XP in Northshire (stock)
as gm .character level 1
pick w creature:299 near c
do gm target w
as gm .respawn
wait 6s
pick w creature:299 near c
require w alive
do c approach w
wait 1s
do c cast 42921 triggered
do c cast 42921 triggered
waitfor w dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
do gm target c
as gm .pinfo
expect output value Level == 1

cleanup
do gm target c
as gm .quest remove 90250
as gm .character level 80
